+/*
+ * HT-PHY: the radio can go silent (no beacons, nothing received or sent,
+ * no error reported; seen once in a one-hour soak). The ucode's MAC
+ * statistics show it: in AP mode the beacon counter (txbcnfrm, shm 0xea)
