+ * frame on the channel. An idle AP on a quiet channel can go 15 s without
+ * an RX start, but a working receiver still counts CRS glitches
+ * (rxcrsglitch, shm 0x10e, hundreds per second); a deaf one counts
+ * neither. If the beacons stand still for 15 s, or both RX counters do,
+ * log the state and restart the controller.
